# In-scope domains for the Route53 -> Cloudflare migration, one per line.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored. Matching is
# case-insensitive and ignores a trailing dot.
#
# Copy this file to config/in-scope-zones.txt and commit it, then run the
# Route53 Export workflow (or ./scripts/export_route53.sh with
# IN_SCOPE_ZONES_FILE=config/in-scope-zones.txt). Any hosted zone in the account
# that is NOT listed here is routed to manual review as `out_of_scope_zone`
# instead of being migrated.
#
# Replace the placeholders below with the 12 real in-scope domains.
# domain1.com
# domain2.com
# domain3.com
# domain4.com
# domain5.com
# domain6.com
# domain7.com
# domain8.com
# domain9.com
# domain10.com
# domain11.com
# domain12.com
